  "description": "\"Into your boring routine, dangerous men come who will awaken your instincts.\" Women who led ordinary, moral lives. But one night, at an unexpected time, beast-like men infiltrate their lives. From a childhood friend 20 years ago, through an authoritarian boss they should never get involved with, to a stranger hiding a dangerous secret... \"Flee. Because if I catch you, I won't let you go.\" However, once the line is crossed, no one can turn back.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/beasts_that_cross_the_line)",
